  "merchant/30838.htm": {
   "file": "merchant/30838.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Trader Woodley: Hello, customer! My name is Woodley. That person over there selling a weapon is my twin, Woodrow. Our temperaments aren't exactly the same, though... Ha ha! Well, please have a look around and let me know if you see anything you like.",
